text.section:
An applicant shall submit a registration form established by the Secretary for registering and being commissioned as an electronic notary public, which shall include:

The applicant's full legal and official notary names;


A general description of the technology or technologies the registrant will use to create an electronic signature in performing official acts;


Certification of compliance to the Secretary of the Commonwealth with electronic notary standards developed in accordance with § 47.1-6.1; and


The electronic mail address of the registrant.
